{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "4fc8f7fb020a5605ac4d8ba37922b90a293974b11f3659666b9ab201232a2595", "ja": "しっかり前を向きたくて", "zh": "想认真面对未来", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e34a44abfdab303f32ee4d47112b24e4f4b99250b50cc4b30b2e1e12da419a58", "ja": "練習後、プロレス観戦に向かう奈緒とのり子\nとプロデューサー。夜、プロデューサーが事\n務所に戻ると、亜利沙がひとりでリコッタ写\n真の整理をしていた。亜利沙はリコッタのみ\nんなと仲良くなりたいと話す。", "zh": "练习结束后，\n奈绪、法子和制作人一起去看职业摔角。\n晚上制作人回到事务所，\n看到亚利沙一个人在整理『Ricotta』的照片。\n亚利沙表示想和『Ricotta』的成员变得更要好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1000_028ari", "source_sha256": "2c92697bf8f70cdd00696ed7aa790e257ab56f9f56274bffc2d9f2c2eb7d2461", "ja": "皆さん、おはようございますっ！\n今日はありさ、バッチリ時間に間に合いましたよ！", "zh": "大家早安！\n今天亚利沙来得很准时唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "dcc3daeabf05851230240add65cf2dc650a2afa79f1b76c3b2591f3e051470ae", "ja": "いや、秒単位でギリギリやん。\n桃子がいたらアウト判定やで。", "zh": "哪有，明明差几秒就要迟到了吼。\n要是桃子在的话你就出局啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "c5a43de842a4e10df68a77cdac61c1d889491a737feba5ba040b1aa1f33bed51", "ja": "ううっ……！　奈緒ちゃん、どうか\n桃子ちゃんセンパイには言わないでください～っ！", "zh": "呜呜……！\n奈绪，求你千万不要跟小桃前辈说～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b4ea26c1eecbadb0e64bd1817ecb89ae591f249babad39bf2767d2e3b3b06c8c", "ja": "さてと。今日は春香と桃子が別の仕事でいないから、\nのり子、奈緒、亜利沙の3人でのレッスンだぞ。", "zh": "好啦，今天春香跟桃子有别的工作不能来，\n所以今天的课程只有法子、奈绪和亚利沙三个人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "7593b3cbd9ebace37df83ef08143547eff672766a97887fe55a1389cc1ed602e", "ja": "うんっ！　春香や桃子がいなくても、\nしっかりレッスンしないとね！", "zh": "嗯！就算春香跟桃子不在，\n我们也要认真练习才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "c487fc777f66be24423c0e7bdb61476e441ffaa196a1f8d266e454dd7922521d", "ja": "それじゃあふたりとも、いくよーっ！\nレッスンスタートだ！", "zh": "那么两位，要开始啰──！\n开始练习！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "74f5c3c7c10c57771fd2a8a435be5b388e6ddd6693feb8a793fdd47bb012db32", "ja": "は、はいっ！", "zh": "好、好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "d71ac305c4e9487027314263374bf5f4dc549f9ad0c2fe230e10af592cc72e4c", "ja": "はーい♪", "zh": "好的──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "bccab3afd7b38dab1ac5bf27cac4da9bb173362dba282586599fd3edd8aa3962", "ja": "……ふぅ～っ！　いい汗かいたぁ～！", "zh": "……呼～！流了好多汗～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "86df94a21e3c1d3d9d40de80035bc75b85ce375ca9ece47cb35dc6518d89b046", "ja": "せや、のり子。今晩のこと、\n{$P$}さんに聞かんでええの？", "zh": "对啦，法子，今天晚上的事情，\n你不问{$P$}先生吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "54d55c2591ce3050f26fed8e314b6b6096faf84325a885a49697ac4d1c76f38c", "ja": "あ、そうだった。亜利沙、{$P$}。\n今日の夜って、何か予定ある？", "zh": "啊，对耶。亚利沙、{$P$}，\n今晚你们有事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1011_p", "source_sha256": "fa45b2ac013ee2c51c507a6a8d940f8bb5ba0ef5aef05fb6418ee910000913b0", "ja": "ん？　特にないけど、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "嗯？我今晚没什么事，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "eb76b032d1bcc9c0777a1091a7ccdec597b2e76da58d7aa6153e16c3c2a1e1ce", "ja": "プロレスのチケットが余っててさ。\nよかったら、一緒に行かない？", "zh": "我这里有多的职业摔角的票，\n有空的话要不要一起去看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "7a0c3dff8d3c4da4861ed983b78c00851a8054b560e0f070dfdd1b460befca84", "ja": "ふぇっ？　プロレス……ですか？", "zh": "咦？职业摔角吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "8b9f301d90bb5e9f95a514ef78b17a53c08613778d7b7bc5ba7e1ac63d58e8db", "ja": "うん、アタシの好きな団体の試合！　友達と観に行く\n予定だったんだけど、都合が悪くなっちゃって。", "zh": "嗯，是我喜欢的团体的比赛！\n本来跟朋友约好要去看，但是对方突然不能去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "9cc6fc1d1abc77d61b4be8338daaa1221207d6f42bd209d2a0a5905b65f34e6d", "ja": "でもせっかくの試合だから、空席は作りたくないし……\n助けると思って、お願いっ！", "zh": "不过这是难得的比赛，我不想让位置空下来……\n就当作是帮我一个忙，拜托！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1016_p", "source_sha256": "044b38f19e157914066bfc036112ee43f09e1422471295362df85503c5fce7ce", "ja": "なるほど、プロレスか。\nみんなで観に行ってみるのも、面白そうだな。", "zh": "原来如此，职业摔角啊……\n跟大家一起去看应该也满有趣的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "a6da90359219fc410c943beecb95c94f5005fc08a7d8c18db90f29e33853332d", "ja": "よっしゃあっ、決まりっ♪\n亜利沙はどうする？", "zh": "太棒了，那就这么决定啰♪\n亚利沙呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "81321c7f3723e55efe1f5d0a6bb1f4f85c3aa47b100401a0b22d96cff391ab1e", "ja": "え、えっと～。\n実はありさ、今日はこれから予定があってですね……。", "zh": "呃，那个～\n其实今天亚利沙接下来还有事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "33221a26f3ce8f6e0b69cdb79358a55213ead38aa324a17d331c3532ed34763a", "ja": "あちゃー！　そっかそっか、急だったもんね。\nゴメン、予定を優先してよ！", "zh": "可惜了～！这样啊，是我讲的太临时了。\n抱歉，还是以你原本预定的行程优先吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "9f007dc65c969bb4bca0a79f9955f2305e937548c9497fae694aa212b75ec4a9", "ja": "いえ！　誘ってもらえて、すごく嬉しかったです！\nでもでも……今日はその、ゴメンナサイっ！", "zh": "不会！谢谢你邀亚利沙，亚利沙很开心！\n不过不过……今天就抱歉了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1021_043nor", "source_sha256": "28583db39efa914e0558595fa0787b53431859234d095e8254d74025c5ead83b", "ja": "いいっていいって。\nまた誘うから、その時は一緒に行こうね！", "zh": "没事没事。\n下次再邀你，到时候再一起去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "715aad2ef968af57b84e51abc0845773b0c842281e29f8a51053b68d9e3ae177", "ja": "はい……！", "zh": "好的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1023_p", "source_sha256": "94c25c8ca015edc2658464c2e83f51a6269cd0e4df8be6702f9ed23d91b1c546", "ja": "（のり子と奈緒とプロレス観戦。アイドルステージ\nにも負けないくらい、凄い盛り上がりだった……！）", "zh": "（跟法子和奈绪一起看了职业摔角。\n现场气氛十分热烈，不亚于偶像表演……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1024_043nor", "source_sha256": "0aa2ed71317df4baf2684f57e043c892aea9d3d3d4c8f82d065b5184ebec4bc7", "ja": "いや～、今日の試合はよかったな～！\nフィニッシュ、強烈だったね！", "zh": "哎呀～今天的比赛太棒了～！\n最后面真是太刺激了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1025_037nao", "source_sha256": "841709a5ad87f42cbefa2b2fadb0f409d46f8428c6f16391131b5a91b9b24005", "ja": "ホンマ、夢中になってもうたわ！　場外で\nお客さんを煽るとことか、めっちゃマネしたいわ～。", "zh": "真的，我都看到入迷啦！\n我好想学他们那样在擂台外炒热观众气氛啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1026_p", "source_sha256": "5045273805ae711f153cb57170bd4d9c84682f380900b21944e7424a5fb40b09", "ja": "はは、いいけどアイドルらしく頼むぞ？\nあと、セットにも気を付けて。", "zh": "哈哈，可以是可以，但拜托你表现得像个偶像喔。\n还有注意不要弄坏布景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1027_037nao", "source_sha256": "ecfa4be32333a39325632295ac7887798f77d7e9578f3ffbfcf8e13daaaa6884", "ja": "わかってますって！　なあなあ、今日はこの後、\nどうするん？　せっかくやし、なんか食べてかへん？", "zh": "我知道啦！话说，今天接下来要做什么啊？\n难得出来了，要不要吃点什么呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1028_043nor", "source_sha256": "9e428dc7546c0aa8fb93e4ca7cd97fb9b66cf6b7904f4174cbe0d86c92d26351", "ja": "賛成～っ！　何がいいかな～。\nあっ、{$P$}は食べたいものある？", "zh": "赞成～！要吃什么好呢～\n啊，{$P$}有想吃什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1029_p", "source_sha256": "205ccba850691978ab80abdc135cf59428e26dd59bfbe2c9c23175dba0a6df48", "ja": "すまん、俺は事務所に戻らないと……\n仕事連絡が来てないか、一応確認しておきたいからな。", "zh": "抱歉，我还得回事务所……\n我要确认一下有没有工作的事情需要联络。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1030_043nor", "source_sha256": "01d740e0899bab31e3ae291d95ccb9adb8a03e4b387d460ed761989201433f31", "ja": "そっかぁ……{$P$}、\nお仕事大変だね。でも、今度は絶対付き合ってよ！", "zh": "这样啊……{$P$}的工作好辛苦。\n那下次一定要跟我们一起去喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1031_p", "source_sha256": "0a55428bf7fe6f04c7f844d2673bf7600d157f7855f64711dbb1e4b70d3812b7", "ja": "ああ、わかったよ。\nふたりとも、気を付けてな！", "zh": "嗯，我知道了。\n你们要注意安全喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1032_p", "source_sha256": "484b65c914e7f6b88abffed42ae92a0756cb009144e68ff8b36df64cc050e057", "ja": "さて。\n俺も遅くなる前に……ん？　電気がついてる？", "zh": "好了，趁着时间还没有很晚……\n嗯？灯怎么亮着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1033_p", "source_sha256": "d8859c37741fc30d6c953d07d467f9c31d286168fb600e0d6547d9b6e6433941", "ja": "こんな時間なのに、誰かいるのか？", "zh": "这个时间，会有谁在呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1034_028ari", "source_sha256": "6aebfd12a4d0bfad91469cd16a8f172fc2a25face10915886a16e0f000e0ab65", "ja": "はっ！？\n{$P$}さん……！", "zh": "啊！？\n{$P$}先生……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1035_p", "source_sha256": "41f2248d110f408de18444cad72f5738d235334f08d608af611c20cfbd80955d", "ja": "亜利沙……？　こんな時間に、どうしたんだ。\n今日は用事があるんじゃなかったのか？", "zh": "亚利沙……？你怎么这个时间还在这里？\n你今天不是有事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1036_028ari", "source_sha256": "0f92fd7e70b92d42e1ae14fbd0f07e8202823c4ec39aa60e66dd8c057b22711b", "ja": "は、はい。ありさ、用事が早く終わったので、\n事務所に戻ってきたんです。", "zh": "是、是呀。亚利沙的事情提早结束了，\n所以就回来事务所了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1037_028ari", "source_sha256": "24b8260eae9065bcf0007d8d3a4cb6e17200d69357f7a431b838185ff080f739", "ja": "せっかくなので、今まで撮った写真の整理をしようと\n思って。そうしたら、あっという間に時間が……。", "zh": "想说难得有空档，来整理一下目前为止拍的照片，\n结果一转眼就到这个时间了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1038_p", "source_sha256": "9fe2b428948f5c53126f4f81ac6b842612e687b268f7f93d4c3f86099bd6a934", "ja": "これは……へえ、リコッタのみんなとの練習風景か。\nどれもいきいきした、いい写真だな。", "zh": "这是……哦，原来是『Ricotta』的大家在练习的画面，\n每一张都看起来很有活力，拍得真好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1039_028ari", "source_sha256": "7a34ae306c53254ecdb7c2b3567395f68c7b0f5ee897552d2e4562b5335c27b4", "ja": "ムフフ……♪　ありさ、アイドルちゃんの\n写真撮影に関しては、かなり自信がありますからっ！", "zh": "唔呼呼……♪\n亚利沙对于拍偶像宝贝的照片，可是很有自信的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1040_028ari", "source_sha256": "58fe55c623a7479f84a683201602626312214a2597e10122258ffc346fa9d2d6", "ja": "こういうのはアルバムにするまでがお仕事なんですよ？\nありさの宝物、特別に公開しちゃいますね！", "zh": "这些照片在收进相簿之前都还不能算是完成，\n就特别让你看看亚利沙的宝物吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1041_028ari", "source_sha256": "2cd64e9fda17233a84b3abaef86087ee98dcda51153214f3843b633f7b1ee97a", "ja": "この写真とか、見てください！　のり子ちゃんの\nボケに反応する奈緒ちゃんの、貴重なツッコミシーン！", "zh": "你看这张照片！小法在装傻，奈绪在接她的哏，\n是珍贵的吐槽画面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1042_p", "source_sha256": "31e0603f3548eed3c958aeb266a46809c67520e187ce747efa68a81cde181135", "ja": "なるほど、貴重かもしれない……ん、こっちはなんだ？\n桃子が、怪訝そうな顔をしているが……。", "zh": "原来如此，这的确算是满珍贵的……嗯？这是什么？\n桃子的表情看起来不太开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1043_028ari", "source_sha256": "9953dc57ca72f4fc934887e6fb54c49a1c182da84dcd6b5f88d3362939cabd45", "ja": "それは、踏み台の上からありさを叱る桃子ちゃん\nセンパイです！　とってもキュートです～っ♪", "zh": "那是站在垫脚凳上斥责亚利沙的小桃前辈！\n真的好可爱～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1044_028ari", "source_sha256": "f1ae75fc4ad79e4ce91a13dbbf279a64dce2d11aebc62518c559f1a49b16b32c", "ja": "そしてこちらが激レア！　偶然にも春香さんが\n転ぶ瞬間を、コマ送り連写した写真です！", "zh": "然后这张超级稀有！\n是春香不小心摔倒的瞬间连拍画面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1045_p", "source_sha256": "b5c680c018affd7a241850fe9e407d068ddaa19a65e554b9a6e31901dca710e2", "ja": "すごいな……。もしかしたらこれは、\nレッスンの参考にもなるんじゃないか？", "zh": "好厉害……\n这说不定可以作为训练课程的参考喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1046_028ari", "source_sha256": "705fb62f412918f36641b32c8155f64df5ec5608baceed4ab584ca2d62a50097", "ja": "！　{$P$}さん、ホントですか？\nありさの写真、役に立ちそうですか？", "zh": "真的吗！{$P$}先生！？\n亚利沙拍的照片可以派上用场吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1047_p", "source_sha256": "fa485162696920fbd8574ec1d91d251e436ce24f0b7ee50c9e0ea228bb937e16", "ja": "ああ、役に立つと思う。でもそれだけじゃなくて……\nみんなとの絆を感じる、本当にいい写真だよ。", "zh": "嗯，我觉得可以派上用场。但是不只是这样……\n从这些照片中可以感受到大家的羁绊，真的拍得很好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1048_028ari", "source_sha256": "c7325e258ce2540527d3a75166d7a03ce8e74d5fb9d962b0635590482b918392", "ja": "ふわぁ……！", "zh": "呜哇……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1049_028ari", "source_sha256": "52be1c807fa808a2b5f53be5d0ab41fa8f5bfdf918103b819201fabc4a3dc6b7", "ja": "え、えっと……、{$P$}さん。\nあの～、ですね……。", "zh": "呃，那个……{$P$}先生，\n那个～其实啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1050_028ari", "source_sha256": "efc608120ee02b4b9753530c6c2156894ad8231f62ee6278ceb03c36d380a4c2", "ja": "ありさ、今まであんまり……その。\nお、お友達が、いたことがなくてですね……。", "zh": "亚利沙一直以来……那个……\n没、没交过什么朋友……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1051_p", "source_sha256": "0686b46353ae300abef6011d768760e49ac9a43e42ff14d1758ccaf7324ef3e2", "ja": "え、そうだったのか？\nそれは意外だな……。", "zh": "咦，这样吗？\n真是意外……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1052_028ari", "source_sha256": "8101a4b65f3af06a006442cb3823958047b7397d4e5c8ccca583e428e08d9b08", "ja": "ありさ、昔からずっとアイドルちゃんが好きで、\nちょっと変わってましたから……えへへ。", "zh": "亚利沙从以前开始就很喜欢偶像宝贝，\n又有点怪怪的……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1053_028ari", "source_sha256": "f8a6574604f2c0a91f2f054bfb026ca300e7dc590a869d89b80193400434bc30", "ja": "でもでも！　劇場のみんなはやさしくて、\nありさ、とっても感激してるんですっ！", "zh": "不过不过！剧场里的每个人都很和善，\n亚利沙觉得非常感谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1054_028ari", "source_sha256": "647040f47e42209d17874a7c0586860bf5981e865081873f51a649366f69250a", "ja": "特にリコッタのみんなは、\nいつもたくさん、ありさを気にかけてくれて……。", "zh": "特别是『Ricotta』的大家，\n总是非常关照亚利沙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1055_p", "source_sha256": "a5b585db86f9ad57a02a10365ad29261d1d5449b41ed4b2a26a1423eb029c9e3", "ja": "亜利沙……。", "zh": "亚利沙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1056_028ari", "source_sha256": "4be1c19c5f57bd70a4b590c190610932fbfffbf03a9b515426af959d4706c81f", "ja": "な、なので！　ありさは……\nありさは、みんなの役に立ちたいですっ！", "zh": "所、所以！亚利沙……\n亚利沙想帮上大家的忙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1057_028ari", "source_sha256": "07b5373dceef41dfd089a7a4fbf3056485a096c6de3a6694cfd29ca963472bd2", "ja": "そしたらありさは……ありさも、リコッタのメンバー\nなんだって。む、胸を張って言える気がするので……！", "zh": "这样亚利沙……亚利沙感觉就可以抬头挺胸地说，\n自己是『Ricotta』的成员……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1058_p", "source_sha256": "27185e1ad07e2817470e735dfead06b60d50adba82e53a278348e852b6469734", "ja": "メンバーのこと、大事に思ってるんだな。\nなら、亜利沙はもう……。", "zh": "你很重视其他成员吧。\n这样亚利沙就已经是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_1059", "source_sha256": "c89831a0e55e5f394dafe43a35eed072671cf3c28c725b7df2d6e0470f6d824a", "ja": "もうメンバーだ", "zh": "已经是成员了", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_2000_p", "source_sha256": "dacc85df995045ecae8cca43328e19051f2b720bcf5252fb2566af90f60d3c4d", "ja": "もう、立派なリコッタのメンバーだ。他のメンバーが\n亜利沙を大事に思ってるのと、同じ気持ちだから。", "zh": "亚利沙已经是优秀的『Ricotta』成员了。\n你的心情跟其他成员重视亚利沙的心情是一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_2001_028ari", "source_sha256": "3f4a178c444a064f2f94dd1598b5eed77770c9a281a9ded807d1bfe4df58efc0", "ja": "{$P$}さん……！\nうう、わ、わかりました……！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……！\n呜呜，亚、亚利沙明白了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_2002_028ari", "source_sha256": "9e235cc1b4807d93e2518d765e4dd9db3d711c5efab38dbfd509cb8e8c862d27", "ja": "ありさ、頑張ります！　リコッタのみんなと一緒に、\n本番のライブ、絶対に成功させてみせますーっ！", "zh": "亚利沙会加油的！一定要和『Ricotta』的大家一起，\n让正式演唱会演出成功！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_2003_p", "source_sha256": "9d15eabd6c9fe354c59fd25032ad29fc446828541a601576f610f8fa0b9087cb", "ja": "よし、その意気だぞ亜利沙！　みんなと\nライブを成功させて、お客さんを楽しませような！", "zh": "很好，这种心态就对了，亚利沙！\n跟大家一起让演唱会成功，让观众开开心心的吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_2004_028ari", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_03_2005_028ari", "source_sha256": "a452e28738897919e591f951d051e4f88663ebd9b256f39da599f8e58c04d181", "ja": "そしたら、リコッタのみんなとも、\nもっともっと仲良く……ムフ、ムフフ……♪", "zh": "这样一来也能增进『Ricotta』大家的感情……\n唔呼、唔呼呼……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
